# Momento systems roadmap

Canonical tracker: `docs/architecture/MOMENTO_SYSTEMS_ROADMAP.md`.
Repo is source of truth. Notion is a readable copy.

October 1, 2026 = NBA/NCAAB **dual-market ingest + Autoingest**.
Not Terminito. Not RV HFT. Not agentic traders. Not “everything finished.”

```text
Vital + ROLLER (now)
  → Polymarket 1m LAST_TRADE_PRINT (before Oct 1)
  → Autoingest + Autojest (around Oct 1)
  → Kalshi + Poly + PBP intersection (explicit PIT op, later)
  → ROLLER 1m realism → SuperASI A/B correction
  → Correlation → ITI Robust Optimized
  → Terminito X/Y/MCS → Z → Fluctuations
  → same-game RV (Todd Klein) → long-term hold EV
  → Cloud Momento → Agentic traders (Vital only)
```

## Naming

- Autoingest = acquisition + validation program.
- Autojest = its dashboard. New Vite surface. Not Jump. Not Vital.

## Do not

- Start warehouse Phase 21, Confirm & Run cutover, or W9.
- Change live FIRST01 / 80/81/83/89.
- Treat Polymarket as Kalshi TOB or merge venues into one quote.
- Invent missing minutes, OHLC, bid/ask, L2, fills, or PIT.
- Treat candle path as a fill. Missing is never `$0`.
- Build Terminito / Fluctuations / RV on assumed sync.
- Claim PBP↔candle PIT done (today `OPERATION_REQUIRED`).
- Dump the local filesystem into a cloud bucket.
- Give agents live bankroll before research → paper → limited live.

Joint Kalshi + Polymarket in one question stays `OPERATION_REQUIRED`
until program 4 ships as a named operation.
